DESCRIPTION:Join Blair and the Appalachian Foodways Club in the field to le
 arn about milo\, or grain sorghum\, followed by a hands-on introduction to
  collecting grain from outside the designated harvest zone before the main
  harvest.\n\n \n\nWith Blair’s guidance\, we’ll gather grain to explor
 e in the kitchen and use at ReHarvest. We’ll also have an opportunity to
  return for postharvest gleaning—collecting grain left behind after the 
 crop has been harvested.
GEO:35.613818;-82.438862
LOCATION:Warren Wilson College Farm
SUMMARY: Milo Sorghum: Field Discussion & Grain Harvest with Blair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/milo-sorghum-field-dis
