DESCRIPTION:Bring your lunch and join a conversation from a Warren Wilson A
 lumni\, Rev. Dr. McCloud who is a nationally recognized Presbyterian minis
 ter\, civil rights advocate\, and author whose life journey spans from gro
 wing up as the son of Georgia sharecroppers to serving in prominent leader
 ship roles within the Presbyterian Church. He has been actively involved i
 n the Civil Rights Movement\, racial equity initiatives\, international ch
 urch leadership\, and the anti-apartheid movement in South Africa. He is a
 lso the author of I Dared to Hope: How a Passion for Justice Transformed a
  Sharecropper's Son\, a memoir reflecting on faith\, perseverance\, educat
 ion\, and social justice.
GEO:35.610912;-82.442142
LOCATION:Canon Lounge in Gladfelter Student Center
SUMMARY:Lunch & Learn- Rev. Oscar McCloud
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/lunch-learn-rev-oscar-
 mccloud
